    "summary": "Cloth: skirt: composed of seven indigo dyed cotton narrow strips hand sewn together selvedge to selvedge. The warps are knotted along one edge. The cloth is decorated with embroidery in the centrel. The selvedges are embroidered with dyed red cotton cross stitches, while the narrow strips are embroidered with chains of oblongs and diamonds in red, green and yellow cotton.",
